    "created_at": "2025-02-14T13:54:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-14T13:54:22Z",
    "body": "I'm opposed to supporting more legacy encodings. It undermines our push to get everyone on UTF-8.\n\nIn this case, the encodings have been obsolete for 20 years, and I can't find any demand from users to support them.\n\nI honestly doubt anyone would notice if WebKit removed support.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
